    "regime_notes": "Positive IC in all four regimes: 2020-2024 0.015276; 2025-2027 0.040858; 2028-2029 0.018515; 2030-2032-02-04 0.061005. The 10-day horizon failed the ICIR gate, so admission uses 5-day horizon only. Small cross-section (15 assets) implies conservative uncertainty interpretation.",
